    },
    "atom::79eed18f2d0fc11322a56381": {
      "atom_id": "atom::79eed18f2d0fc11322a56381",
      "source_handle": "P0597",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "明确HLA多态性如何决定心肌炎患者是清除病毒自愈，还是发展为持续性自身免疫损伤进而导致DCM；识别当前研究中的知识空白以指导临床转化。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::403b70186842af42ce31ed58334f0270beb3caf28b3d3ab63299b6b3e475d62c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3fcf5f1dc4355ecf21429ad5947c4796877bb670f007d9cebd8f9c9f3f315529",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c8074a4e4ec33b1d79d1156f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c8074a4e4ec33b1d79d1156f",
      "source_handle": "P0597",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "心肌炎（Myocarditis）和扩张型心肌病（DCM）；人类白细胞抗原（HLA）系统多态性；适应性免疫、分子模拟、自身免疫机制。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::403b70186842af42ce31ed58334f0270beb3caf28b3d3ab63299b6b3e475d62c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a773f85ae993d0625b8e0210e154471a01e5af134f1d3c01a7ec8f4564f2357c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b2cb4b4df74b55977a1a9e10": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b2cb4b4df74b55977a1a9e10",
      "source_handle": "P0597",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在阐明HLA多态性在心肌炎进展、抵抗及结局中的作用。文章梳理了HLA通过抗原呈递影响适应性免疫的机制，包括HLA-I类分子介导的抗病毒反应和HLA-II类分子驱动的自身免疫过程。重点讨论了分子模拟、病毒持续感染、微生物组相互作用等机制如何导致从急性炎症向慢性自身免疫性DCM的转变。同时，文章评估了现有遗传关联研究的局限性（如样本量小、人群单一），并提出了未来研究方向，包括多民族基因组研究、病毒表位映射及基于HLA分层的临床试验。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::403b70186842af42ce31ed58334f0270beb3caf28b3d3ab63299b6b3e475d62c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2c1c87b093129287b1f1567e1e1848111b172943dc550c198c10a5c8ebd47801",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8938b61d48acde2f8424e984": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8938b61d48acde2f8424e984",
      "source_handle": "P0597",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述提供了HLA介导的自身免疫机制的详细背景，特别是“分子模拟”概念不仅限于病毒-心脏抗原，还扩展到了“微生物组-心脏抗原”。这为理解宿主遗传背景（HLA）如何通过环境因素（微生物组）调节免疫反应提供了理论框架。虽然不直接涉及实体瘤或ICIs，但其关于HLA限制性的抗原呈递机制、T细胞克隆扩增及耐受失败的描述，可作为理解肿瘤微环境中免疫逃逸或免疫治疗响应差异的类比素材。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::403b70186842af42ce31ed58334f0270beb3caf28b3d3ab63299b6b3e475d62c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::800b14a364eb1a69e17a273e23d95be7735ebc36dd1b9dfe0b3dfc95eb2f2345",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::bcee5c45aeaa1785a0003ea4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bcee5c45aeaa1785a0003ea4",
      "source_handle": "P0597",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "研究对象为心脏组织而非肿瘤组织；机制侧重于感染后自身免疫，而非肿瘤抗原识别。不能直接外推至ICI疗效预测。",
        "contribution": "提供了HLA限制性抗原呈递导致特异性T细胞激活的详细机制，包括HLA-I/II类分子在病毒清除与自身免疫启动中的不同角色。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::403b70186842af42ce31ed58334f0270beb3caf28b3d3ab63299b6b3e475d62c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::757a24bb8ae0877a1e9f070ec4b48fa72a1cc1103e9d000f82e8ea714adeead4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ab891c18333bf99c6ddc5c8e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ab891c18333bf99c6ddc5c8e",
      "source_handle": "P0597",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于解释宿主遗传变异如何决定对特定病原体或治疗诱导的免疫反应的敏感性。虽然对象不同，但“HLA-抗原-T细胞”互作的基本原理相通。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::403b70186842af42ce31ed58334f0270beb3caf28b3d3ab63299b6b3e475d62c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f64a37ed518d8c23198ef4d5862e9e08690027622717a60b068e9bfb7edbb60f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d0ac2ec8e3533214f7adbefd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d0ac2ec8e3533214f7adbefd",
      "source_handle": "P0597",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "直接因果链条是“微生物-心脏自身免疫”，而非“微生物-ICI疗效”。需明确这是跨体系的借鉴，而非直接回答ICI相关问题。",
        "contribution": "详细阐述了微生物组来源的肽段如何通过分子模拟激活自体反应性T细胞，并指出抗生素干预可阻断这一过程。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::403b70186842af42ce31ed58334f0270beb3caf28b3d3ab63299b6b3e475d62c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::757a24bb8ae0877a1e9f070ec4b48fa72a1cc1103e9d000f82e8ea714adeead4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e46eab0aa35bc20b011802dc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e46eab0aa35bc20b011802dc",
      "source_handle": "P0597",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "为“微生物组调节免疫反应”提供机制层面的支持证据。可类比用于讨论肠道菌群如何通过代谢产物或抗原模拟影响全身免疫状态，进而可能间接影响肿瘤免疫微环境或ICI疗效。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::403b70186842af42ce31ed58334f0270beb3caf28b3d3ab63299b6b3e475d62c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f64a37ed518d8c23198ef4d5862e9e08690027622717a60b068e9bfb7edbb60f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ca0869648ee1c7d4fe289d9c": {
