    "atom::fa99dc31a127d0721858a238": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fa99dc31a127d0721858a238",
      "source_handle": "P0596",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用生物信息学综合分析路线：1. 数据获取与分组：使用GSE180045数据集，分为三组（A: ICI无不良事件；B: ICI非心肌炎免疫不良事件；C: ICI心肌炎），以C组为病例组，A/B组为对照组。2. 基因筛选：计算C组与对照组的差异表达基因（DEGs），并与immPort数据库中的1,796个免疫相关基因（IRGs）取交集，获得IR-DEGs。3. 网络与功能分析：对IR-DEGs进行GO、KEGG、GSEA功能富集分析，构建PPI网络识别hub genes。4. 验证与特征提取：使用GSE4172数据集进行验证，从hub genes与DEGs的重叠部分中确定最优特征基因（OFGs）。5. 调控网络与药物预测：预测靶miRNAs并构建ceRNA网络；利用cMAP数据库预测靶向hub genes的药物。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8db7d226573ffbf52b992735e9c2567365fe574dd629af2c498c1be3b27c6967",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7a7cc006103c661abb22210a8b36f713c106596f16305e2a65a730a8ac302923",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::fb071f580ffb440489ca3272": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fb071f580ffb440489ca3272",
      "source_handle": "P0596",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了ICI-MC潜在的分子机制假说，特别是强调了细胞毒性T细胞和NK细胞相关通路（如CD8+ TCR、细胞裂解）的作用。",
        "limits": "所给摘要未交代临床样本的具体来源医院、患者基线特征（如肿瘤类型、分期）、测序平台细节及统计分析的具体阈值。结论基于生物信息学预测，缺乏湿实验（如qPCR、Western Blot或组织染色）的直接验证，因果链条尚未在生物学层面确证。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8db7d226573ffbf52b992735e9c2567365fe574dd629af2c498c1be3b27c6967",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::aac0a3fba0c5688ce99c8ea6edcbe57b6dd6dcbb8ca5d74ad07c001748870e22",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::782b46c3b1a7aaae12e6eefe": {
      "atom_id": "atom::782b46c3b1a7aaae12e6eefe",
      "source_handle": "P0596",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "识别了KLRB1, NKG7, GZMH作为ICI-MC的关键候选标志物，并提出了避免使用乙酰羟肟酸的临床警示。",
        "limits": "药物预测仅基于cMAP数据库的连接评分，未评估药物在心肌炎模型中的实际疗效或安全性，仅为潜在线索而非临床建议。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8db7d226573ffbf52b992735e9c2567365fe574dd629af2c498c1be3b27c6967",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::aac0a3fba0c5688ce99c8ea6edcbe57b6dd6dcbb8ca5d74ad07c001748870e22",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::741067959ab3b2f38766ef9f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::741067959ab3b2f38766ef9f",
      "source_handle": "P0596",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "基于GSE180045数据集的比较分析",
        "finding": "在ICI-MC样本与对照组之间鉴定出58个DEGs，经与免疫基因库交集后得到32个IR-DEGs。功能富集显示这些基因主要涉及细胞裂解、CD8+ T细胞受体信号通路、自然杀伤细胞介导的细胞毒性以及RAGE信号通路。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8db7d226573ffbf52b992735e9c2567365fe574dd629af2c498c1be3b27c6967",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e08152760f5b54b106db704667a3a49222c73581bb34a00eccba39f6dd4f9148",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f0c40f3c4ace348a8269d505": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f0c40f3c4ace348a8269d505",
      "source_handle": "P0596",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "PPI网络分析与枢纽基因识别",
        "finding": "鉴定出显著上调的枢纽基因，包括IL7R, PRF1, GNLY, CD3G, NKG7, GZMH, GZMB, KLRB1, KLRK1和CD247。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8db7d226573ffbf52b992735e9c2567365fe574dd629af2c498c1be3b27c6967",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e08152760f5b54b106db704667a3a49222c73581bb34a00eccba39f6dd4f9148",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d709b7dcab1a9f0a9a721fb8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d709b7dcab1a9f0a9a721fb8",
      "source_handle": "P0596",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "基于GSE4172数据集的验证",
        "finding": "在验证数据集中发现407个DEGs，最终确定3个最优特征基因（OFGs）：KLRB1, NKG7, GZMH。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8db7d226573ffbf52b992735e9c2567365fe574dd629af2c498c1be3b27c6967",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
