    "atom::39a51391c828adf32d9f79fb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::39a51391c828adf32d9f79fb",
      "source_handle": "P0596",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "empirical",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8db7d226573ffbf52b992735e9c2567365fe574dd629af2c498c1be3b27c6967",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::cf1544fae18e291b65d280a93d21c749aa487206bc38593c2dcaf2353676cd82",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::d24f5cc50aebffb5ce632d6e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d24f5cc50aebffb5ce632d6e",
      "source_handle": "P0596",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "ICI相关心肌炎（ICI-MC）是一种严重且可能致命的并发症，其具体的病理生理机制尚不清楚。本研究旨在识别ICI-MC中的关键免疫相关基因，发现潜在的治疗靶点，并为临床用药提供警示。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8db7d226573ffbf52b992735e9c2567365fe574dd629af2c498c1be3b27c6967",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4d75171d8f86e2bf872780bb1b583373f69800dcf6d617b8e824fb9e9bb7c7fe",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2a39c8f18234c1b29d535a03": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2a39c8f18234c1b29d535a03",
      "source_handle": "P0596",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "本研究聚焦于免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗过程中出现的罕见且严重的并发症——ICI相关心肌炎（ICI-MC）。研究对象为接受ICI治疗的实体瘤患者群体，通过生物信息学方法分析基因表达数据，旨在揭示该并发症的潜在病理生理机制及治疗靶点。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8db7d226573ffbf52b992735e9c2567365fe574dd629af2c498c1be3b27c6967",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ac300ca4b541be304dd6511f1a01e7e8f7bbc464716702ef82be6e5c75cb4edc",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::cac02c8086d382551bc007a1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cac02c8086d382551bc007a1",
      "source_handle": "P0596",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "针对ICI相关心肌炎（ICI-MC）发病机制不明的问题，本研究利用GSE180045数据集，对比了ICI治疗无免疫不良反应患者、有非心肌炎免疫不良反应患者与发生心肌炎患者之间的差异。研究通过筛选差异表达基因并与免疫相关基因库交集，结合功能富集分析、蛋白互作网络构建及独立数据集验证，识别出关键枢纽基因和潜在的治疗药物靶点，并构建了ceRNA调控网络以阐明分子机制。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8db7d226573ffbf52b992735e9c2567365fe574dd629af2c498c1be3b27c6967",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::aa050fb2f3370864705aab82472d16ee61931e9dbf8f7b7e131267c13ad8e2a8",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::5bfd3b5a35578afe63aaa0fa": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5bfd3b5a35578afe63aaa0fa",
      "source_handle": "P0596",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "区分了ICI引起的不同免疫不良反应亚型（无事件、非心肌炎免疫事件、心肌炎），并指出心肌炎具有独特的基因表达谱（如RAGE信号、细胞裂解）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8db7d226573ffbf52b992735e9c2567365fe574dd629af2c498c1be3b27c6967",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5b0a6061daf10cd6c6239fce9c5dbd15994b303aafb3d496126feaa374b43f5f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d3024e1b23bcd4dec2a413c1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d3024e1b23bcd4dec2a413c1",
      "source_handle": "P0596",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses",
        "connection_to_review"
      ],
      "value": "有助于综述中更精细地分类irAEs，强调不同器官毒性可能有不同的分子驱动机制，这可能受到局部微环境（包括微生物组）的影响。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
