        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "肠道微生物群及其代谢产物与肿瘤免疫微环境（TME）的相互作用，重点聚焦于免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）在实体瘤治疗中的疗效调节机制及临床转化策略。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c183d3c43c6ebd205c205690fc966d52a77942daf7804c18e24bf731c4e7cf85",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d05e4f3850da061263b73c390e696cef9c915ffca06198f1c16e42ddce620d22",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::dc8290ae49c68cca22efdfe9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::dc8290ae49c68cca22efdfe9",
      "source_handle": "P0319",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "这是一篇综述文章，系统总结了肠道微生物代谢物如何通过调节先天免疫、适应性免疫和肿瘤免疫原性来影响肿瘤免疫治疗的疗效。文章详细阐述了短链脂肪酸、胆汁酸、色氨酸代谢物等关键代谢物的具体分子机制，并评估了益生菌、工程菌、粪菌移植（FMT）及饮食干预等临床转化策略的现状与挑战。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c183d3c43c6ebd205c205690fc966d52a77942daf7804c18e24bf731c4e7cf85",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d1a7e3059c6ecd2aa2f80d9c79988ff4ff329a2db2c0c3b179b46285ca6df33c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
