    },
    "atom::98529bcc7179f461230f136d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::98529bcc7179f461230f136d",
      "source_handle": "P0486",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用系统性文献回顾与综合的方法。作者按主题分类整理现有研究证据：1) 识别与CRC进展相关的关键微生物物种及其特异性代谢产物；2) 归纳这些代谢物在分子水平上的作用机制（如信号通路激活、炎症诱导、免疫细胞功能调节、表观遗传修饰）；3) 汇总关于益生菌、益生元、工程菌及代谢物补充剂在改善ICB耐药性和增强抗肿瘤免疫反应方面的临床前及临床研究数据；4) 评估微生物标志物在早期筛查和预后监测中的诊断性能。文章未进行新的实验研究或Meta分析，而是对已发表文献进行定性综合与机制解析。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c00cf96a1c40711a1f547ab22b358fd426fde384d108c3eb0f8c25b68252d73a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::84b03fecb689b2a31c87ab5cd3fd86cb280b0f695a29c6d4e09fcdf87408ee92",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::956573fb132f8ed6d3e68f40": {
      "atom_id": "atom::956573fb132f8ed6d3e68f40",
      "source_handle": "P0486",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物代谢产物调控CRC免疫微环境的全面机制框架，特别强调了代谢物对ICB疗效的双向调节作用（抑制vs增强）。",
        "limits": "所给摘要未交代具体的文献检索策略、纳入排除标准及质量评价方法，因此无法判断其证据综合的系统性或偏倚风险。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c00cf96a1c40711a1f547ab22b358fd426fde384d108c3eb0f8c25b68252d73a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::74b273fef2d0d155d34bccc4ad39ca47baeb1ae9560360b222c4edbf635df954",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::91c2c2275af0f9540fb00398": {
      "atom_id": "atom::91c2c2275af0f9540fb00398",
      "source_handle": "P0486",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "总结了多种微生物来源的代谢物作为ICB增敏剂的潜在机制和临床前证据，为开发新型免疫佐剂提供了理论依据。",
        "limits": "多数增强ICB疗效的证据来自小鼠模型或体外实验，人类临床试验数据有限且结果尚不一致，临床转化存在不确定性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c00cf96a1c40711a1f547ab22b358fd426fde384d108c3eb0f8c25b68252d73a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::74b273fef2d0d155d34bccc4ad39ca47baeb1ae9560360b222c4edbf635df954",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9c55c21e710739cda734ca10": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9c55c21e710739cda734ca10",
      "source_handle": "P0486",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "指出了微生物标志物在CRC无创诊断中的应用价值，并对比了其与传统方法的优劣。",
        "limits": "不同研究中使用的微生物标记物和代谢物组合缺乏标准化，且受饮食、地理、个体差异等因素影响较大，通用性有待验证。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c00cf96a1c40711a1f547ab22b358fd426fde384d108c3eb0f8c25b68252d73a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::74b273fef2d0d155d34bccc4ad39ca47baeb1ae9560360b222c4edbf635df954",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ba0ee9fbe3a365b83e853325": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ba0ee9fbe3a365b83e853325",
      "source_handle": "P0486",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "在CRC肿瘤微环境中",
        "finding": "有害代谢物（如F. nucleatum产生的琥珀酸、次级胆汁酸DCA/LCA、4-HPA）通过抑制cGAS-STING通路、阻断CD8+ T细胞功能、招募MDSCs及促进M2型巨噬细胞极化，导致免疫抑制和ICB耐药。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c00cf96a1c40711a1f547ab22b358fd426fde384d108c3eb0f8c25b68252d73a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::32e2e3980271adad6985edf65570450f2cc4914ef4744fa6d94090257e0656e4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6081d94dae81e99c11e39a51": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6081d94dae81e99c11e39a51",
      "source_handle": "P0486",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "在有益菌群存在或补充条件下",
        "finding": "有益代谢物（如丁酸盐、肌苷、IPA）可通过表观遗传重编程（如HDAC抑制）、激活AHR或GPCR受体，逆转T细胞耗竭，促进M1型巨噬细胞极化和CD8+ T细胞浸润，从而增强PD-1/CTLA-4抑制剂的疗效。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c00cf96a1c40711a1f547ab22b358fd426fde384d108c3eb0f8c25b68252d73a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::32e2e3980271adad6985edf65570450f2cc4914ef4744fa6d94090257e0656e4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::763be396154d0c7044f6c938": {
      "atom_id": "atom::763be396154d0c7044f6c938",
      "source_handle": "P0486",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "在诊断应用中",
        "finding": "粪便中特定细菌组合（如F. nucleatum联合其他菌种）及代谢物谱（如胆汁酸、SCFAs差异）显示出区分CRC患者、腺瘤患者与健康人的高准确性（AUC可达0.94），优于传统FIT检测，具有早期筛查潜力。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c00cf96a1c40711a1f547ab22b358fd426fde384d108c3eb0f8c25b68252d73a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::32e2e3980271adad6985edf65570450f2cc4914ef4744fa6d94090257e0656e4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::fda225f9599293ceb0f2a68a": {
