      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a7a42938dbd5105ec1dba39bb40e2dccfb46b63d7862470606d5c860ae178c1b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6cb9a8b70af9b6f4ff35b6b7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6cb9a8b70af9b6f4ff35b6b7",
      "source_handle": "P0486",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物如何通过代谢产物调节实体瘤（特别是CRC）对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICB）的反应提供了详细的机制素材。它不仅涵盖了促进ICB耐药的有害代谢途径，还详细列举了增强ICB疗效的有益代谢机制及相应的干预策略（益生菌、益生元、工程菌）。此外，它还提供了关于微生物标志物在CRC诊断中应用的背景信息，有助于构建“微生物-代谢物-免疫-治疗响应”的综合叙事。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c00cf96a1c40711a1f547ab22b358fd426fde384d108c3eb0f8c25b68252d73a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::78c942782415a5fd82c22687f1bd687dc5e9ec938b076d9da4dd66dc621c44ca",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::6201a6f65c462a3974e884de": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6201a6f65c462a3974e884de",
      "source_handle": "P0486",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "本文主要聚焦于结直肠癌（CRC），虽然引用了其他癌症（如黑色素瘤、膀胱癌）的研究来佐证某些机制的普遍性，但在应用于其他实体瘤时需注意物种和微环境差异。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c00cf96a1c40711a1f547ab22b358fd426fde384d108c3eb0f8c25b68252d73a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::15c6f76afc95770f15221b9787c2fde1e4c3c1a05a4b069703d3c40f225d605e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d6ac368a0aac6a37c445ca7c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d6ac368a0aac6a37c445ca7c",
      "source_handle": "P0486",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中提到的许多机制（如特定代谢物对T细胞的直接作用）主要基于动物模型或体外实验，人类临床证据相对较少，存在转化不确定性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c00cf96a1c40711a1f547ab22b358fd426fde384d108c3eb0f8c25b68252d73a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::15c6f76afc95770f15221b9787c2fde1e4c3c1a05a4b069703d3c40f225d605e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::3de0bd2e3f8be350abe4a6da": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3de0bd2e3f8be350abe4a6da",
      "source_handle": "P0486",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "微生物标志物的诊断性能受采样方法、人群特征（年龄、地域、饮食）影响较大，不同研究间的结果可能存在异质性，不宜直接视为金标准。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c00cf96a1c40711a1f547ab22b358fd426fde384d108c3eb0f8c25b68252d73a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::15c6f76afc95770f15221b9787c2fde1e4c3c1a05a4b069703d3c40f225d605e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::345221b8e7a8849af8187e89": {
