        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中关于肠道菌群的描述仅限于心肌炎中的交叉反应，不能直接推断该菌株在其他癌症类型中对ICI疗效的影响方向（促进或抑制）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a2614c94467c8f3a48d5173c7cebb8bb2c9844711381",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::42efe37c176680026c94341e962046ffe5795ca35beb5982ce9e511fb036e918",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c5449a2141fe4b2771f18779": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c5449a2141fe4b2771f18779",
      "source_handle": "P0604",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "不要将TN-C在心肌炎中的促炎作用简单等同于其在所有炎症环境中的作用；在某些慢性炎症或纤维化背景下，ECM成分的作用可能复杂多变。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::eaa5eb691eb7f9a7f497a2614c94467c8f3a48d5173c7cebb8bb2c9844711381",
          "field_path": [
