    },
    "atom::e748e3dac3ab2dbfcc0539a8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e748e3dac3ab2dbfcc0539a8",
      "source_handle": "P0602",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "PD-1抑制剂诱导的心肌炎的具体发病机制尚不清楚，尤其是肠道菌群是否参与以及其如何通过影响免疫细胞（如Treg）来介导心脏毒性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::98a960a0340563f06718a990ad831efe311fe642fc23eb90abaed535c9f88a8d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::270e201ba482206a4b7d349f0931882ee1b6878d452c0f60edd0a58b91306a1c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c2eb51bc6982e0585c40454a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c2eb51bc6982e0585c40454a",
      "source_handle": "P0602",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "本研究以携带B16-F10黑色素瘤的小鼠为模型，研究PD-1抑制剂（Anti-PD1）诱导的心肌炎（irAEs的一种）。研究对象包括小鼠心脏组织、血清及粪便样本。情境涉及肿瘤免疫治疗背景下的免疫相关不良事件机制探索。范围限定在小鼠体内实验，未涉及人类临床数据直接验证。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::98a960a0340563f06718a990ad831efe311fe642fc23eb90abaed535c9f88a8d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5e941a68d41c1064078c5d8a696136dc77cba040ff220ad613085489bd536f26",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::80adee1c8926e7478ffad7f5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::80adee1c8926e7478ffad7f5",
      "source_handle": "P0602",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究旨在阐明PD-1抑制剂导致心肌炎的潜在机制，特别是肠道菌群与调节性T细胞（Treg）之间的关联。研究人员构建了黑色素瘤小鼠模型，给予PD-1抑制剂诱导心肌炎，并通过16S rRNA测序分析肠道菌群变化，流式细胞术和qPCR检测心脏免疫细胞及基因表达。研究发现PD-1抑制剂导致心脏内Treg数量减少和功能基因下调，同时改变肠道菌群组成。通过抗生素清除肠道菌群（FMR），发现可显著减轻心肌损伤并恢复Treg功能，提示肠道菌群在PD-1抑制剂诱导的心肌炎中起关键作用。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::98a960a0340563f06718a990ad831efe311fe642fc23eb90abaed535c9f88a8d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c477ce14b611ba5501802110fca49300f8708e5dfcc2f6737e0ec92e5151116c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::738aa42da04f2b419540f3f1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::738aa42da04f2b419540f3f1",
      "source_handle": "P0602",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）心脏毒性机制的重要实证素材，特别是聚焦于“肠道菌群-Treg轴”这一具体通路。它展示了肠道菌群如何作为中介因素，影响ICI治疗后的免疫平衡，进而导致器官特异性毒性。对于综述而言，此文不仅证实了菌群与毒性的关联，还通过干预实验（FMR）提供了反向证据，支持靶向菌群作为缓解毒性的策略。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::98a960a0340563f06718a990ad831efe311fe642fc23eb90abaed535c9f88a8d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3525f9f2a1fd6c95a159ed9f45bb8f30890eda2b8664e97ba0a090b7c83a1544",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7f4672cf172ce3226a15c08c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7f4672cf172ce3226a15c08c",
      "source_handle": "P0602",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限于小鼠模型中的观察和推断，尚未在人体中验证该特定通路；机制细节基于基因表达和相关性，非直接的因果链条证明（如未展示特定代谢物的作用）。",
        "contribution": "详细描述了PD-1抑制剂通过改变肠道菌群组成，进而抑制心脏局部Treg数量和功能（下调FOXP3, IL-10, TGF-β等基因），打破Th17/Treg平衡，导致心肌炎症的具体分子和细胞机制。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::98a960a0340563f06718a990ad831efe311fe642fc23eb90abaed535c9f88a8d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ce8db3e3c5e066f31f0d91c6aafff5ec7eb84effa7d941af1dedfdb7dbd8fe4d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b71c704635d160170840892f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b71c704635d160170840892f",
      "source_handle": "P0602",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于解释ICI心脏毒性的免疫学机制，特别是肠道-心脏轴的作用。可作为“菌群调控免疫细胞功能”这一机制路径的典型例证。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::98a960a0340563f06718a990ad831efe311fe642fc23eb90abaed535c9f88a8d",
          "field_path": [
