      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b1b5c4b54d2dbb8538dcdc29ca550097bf7a4b4f4327338c97f7ea9566f2d500",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::d41f0ae9db0c1a3beadf162b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d41f0ae9db0c1a3beadf162b",
      "source_handle": "P0067",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "这是一项基于现有随机对照试验（ALICE trial, NCT03164993）的回顾性微生物组分析。研究对象为ALICE试验中提供基线及/或治疗后8周粪便样本的患者。方法包括：1. DNA提取与16S rRNA基因V3-V4区扩增测序；2. 生物信息学处理生成ASVs并计算Alpha多样性指标（Faith's PD, Observed ASVs）；3. 使用ANCOM-BC2进行差异丰度分析；4. 使用Kaplan-Meier法和Cox比例风险模型评估微生物组特征与PFS等临床终点的时间-事件关系；5. 通过单变量和多变量Cox模型控制混杂因素；6. 探索性寻找Faith's PD的最佳截断值。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1ff7096bed120980176db78075edf7fcf027d287224195517acf89e71380206d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::06e029cd7f5e626a0873d01a3dbbd426a4042d8a9f1ea3ab70b4c212d33b301a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::d7c02df07a635989b40c0c5b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d7c02df07a635989b40c0c5b",
      "source_handle": "P0067",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "首次在mTNBC接受化疗联合ICI的背景下，证实基线肠道微生物α多样性（特别是Faith's PD）是PFS的独立预后因子，并提示其可能作为预测ICI获益的生物标志物。",
        "limits": "样本量较小（n=70，微生物组分析子集更小），尤其是各治疗亚组样本量有限；研究为探索性分析，需独立队列验证；未分析抗生素使用的影响（仅5例）；生活方式因素（如饮食）数据缺失；不同多样性指数（Observed ASVs vs Faith's PD）结果不一致，提示方法学标准化需求。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1ff7096bed120980176db78075edf7fcf027d287224195517acf89e71380206d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::052d969f0447e96efe8fa121924e464d4bcf4300ffbded1a2b2a2c6e22734d2f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::be1824d65b878563c970dfcd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::be1824d65b878563c970dfcd",
      "source_handle": "P0067",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "所有患者及阿替利珠单抗联合化疗组，基线Faith's PD高于中位数",
        "finding": "与低Faith's PD相比，显著延长PFS（HR 0.56, P=0.04; 优化截断值后HR 0.48, P=0.0098）。在单纯化疗组中未观察到显著关联。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1ff7096bed120980176db78075edf7fcf027d287224195517acf89e71380206d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b54c2315da250e9e2015a529074c1669e9be50d25041ea19de525ff08d06eacb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0cc5012d7a583f6983c8f6ef": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0cc5012d7a583f6983c8f6ef",
      "source_handle": "P0067",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "阿替利珠单抗联合化疗组 vs 安慰剂联合化疗组，基线Faith's PD高 vs 低",
        "finding": "高Faith's PD患者从阿替利珠单抗中获益显著（HR 0.34, P=0.018），而低Faith's PD患者无显著获益（HR 0.83, P=0.62），提示Faith's PD具有预测价值。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1ff7096bed120980176db78075edf7fcf027d287224195517acf89e71380206d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b54c2315da250e9e2015a529074c1669e9be50d25041ea19de525ff08d06eacb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ac88a452af8c8b2e3ab6d54d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ac88a452af8c8b2e3ab6d54d",
      "source_handle": "P0067",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "阿替利珠单抗联合化疗组，基线微生物组成",
        "finding": "双歧杆菌属（Bifidobacterium）在无临床获益患者中显著富集（q=0.008），该发现经独立实验室测序验证。这与既往研究中双歧杆菌与ICI响应正相关的结论相反。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1ff7096bed120980176db78075edf7fcf027d287224195517acf89e71380206d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b54c2315da250e9e2015a529074c1669e9be50d25041ea19de525ff08d06eacb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b81862a4e11f9b34c6fbdec6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b81862a4e11f9b34c6fbdec6",
      "source_handle": "P0067",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "治疗期间（基线至第9周）",
        "finding": "Faith's PD在治疗过程中显著降低。阿替利珠单抗组中，有临床获益患者的双歧杆菌丰度增加，而无获益者保持稳定。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1ff7096bed120980176db78075edf7fcf027d287224195517acf89e71380206d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b54c2315da250e9e2015a529074c1669e9be50d25041ea19de525ff08d06eacb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::86c3a034894ded4aac61b98f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::86c3a034894ded4aac61b98f",
