        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "主要问题：在转移性黑色素瘤中，基线肠道微生物组能否预测ICI的治疗反应和免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）？动机：仅约半数患者对ICI有反应，且10-40%经历irAEs；理解这些因素的底层机制有助于改善预后并减少毒性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ed51308a119087567f15d8b466bfe48bffa1bfeb7fa01cda43973c9a1479fb1f",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::db987b41e0c4422a0b6722216a3c2d542dff532c0bca4b294589795bd5b579c0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::97564157202dd84268e8d014": {
      "atom_id": "atom::97564157202dd84268e8d014",
      "source_handle": "P0314",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "研究对象为接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的转移性黑色素瘤患者。研究情境为俄亥俄州立大学综合癌症中心皮肤癌诊所的单中心前瞻性观察队列。范围限定于基线肠道微生物组对ICI治疗反应（RECIST v1.1标准）及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs，CTCAE v5.0标准）的预测关联。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ed51308a119087567f15d8b466bfe48bffa1bfeb7fa01cda43973c9a1479fb1f",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::460d9f70ee9bfe7fe503480d55834c50cf2017d5740c42485f133d2e655d8eb4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a3f36979553a1fc466731d77": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a3f36979553a1fc466731d77",
      "source_handle": "P0314",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在确定治疗前的肠道微生物组是否能预测转移性黑色素瘤患者对ICI的反应或毒性。研究纳入88名计划接受ICI治疗的患者，其中41名具有完整数据和转移性疾病信息。通过宏基因组鸟枪法测序分析基线粪便样本，比较响应者（R）与非响应者（NR），以及发生irAEs与未发生irAEs患者之间的微生物组成差异。研究发现，特定微生物丰度与治疗反应显著相关，且部分微生物同时与良好反应和低毒性风险相关，提示微生物组可能作为生物标志物或治疗靶点，但研究未确立因果关系。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ed51308a119087567f15d8b466bfe48bffa1bfeb7fa01cda43973c9a1479fb1f",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::276939f1b2c7a39dbfc82d52af7aa03617fd1f807246dd62cb2635adaf27889c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::421ffbc9bcb4eb79fa2d8818": {
      "atom_id": "atom::421ffbc9bcb4eb79fa2d8818",
      "source_handle": "P0314",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了关于肠道微生物组如何与固体肿瘤（黑色素瘤）中对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）的反应及毒性相关联的具体实证数据。其核心价值在于不仅确认了已知的相关菌群（如Lachnospiraceae），还特别指出了与“有效且无毒”这一理想临床结局相关的特定微生物组合，为综述中关于微生物组作为预测生物标志物和治疗调节靶点的讨论提供了具体的分子实体和临床情境证据。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ed51308a119087567f15d8b466bfe48bffa1bfeb7fa01cda43973c9a1479fb1f",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fe4c094da9cf559d9ea19caad194fafc60f4a841e8f757a43d60fc17f3d9287f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::60cbb55146f3b016f0b780fe": {
      "atom_id": "atom::60cbb55146f3b016f0b780fe",
      "source_handle": "P0314",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限转移性黑色素瘤患者；单中心数据；观察性关联，非因果证明；样本量小，特别是irAE亚组；未控制混杂因素如饮食。",
        "contribution": "提供了基线肠道微生物组成分与ICI治疗反应（RECIST标准）及irAEs发生（CTCAE标准）的具体关联列表。例如，Intestinimonas butyriciproducens和Longicatena caecimuris与响应正相关，而Tenericutes与非响应正相关。Blautia luti与“响应且无irAE”状态相关。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ed51308a119087567f15d8b466bfe48bffa1bfeb7fa01cda43973c9a1479fb1f",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a709cbd0bbb6cabb25b3ce5632d7e9177859a4c8d9c440d62ef4f1c9d62352ab",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::5a7260d9b1184211fa85fcf5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5a7260d9b1184211fa85fcf5",
      "source_handle": "P0314",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于综述中列举支持“肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效”的具体微生物证据；用于讨论不同微生物分类群在治疗结果中的差异化作用；作为构建微生物组-疗效关联图谱的具体节点。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ed51308a119087567f15d8b466bfe48bffa1bfeb7fa01cda43973c9a1479fb1f",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::45df919a8f2afcb0625b153f2bb283a3623f604f4d54b8ae48cdc4afeaffa393",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::78ca6ea9f3f192072fcca79e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::78ca6ea9f3f192072fcca79e",
      "source_handle": "P0314",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制多为基于文献的综合推测和本研究的关联提示，本研究本身未直接验证这些机制；具体机制（如肉碱依赖）引用自其他模型系统研究；作者承认机制尚未完全阐明。",
        "contribution": "讨论了Lachnospiraceae可能的作用机制，包括代谢（膳食纤维、异生物质、胆汁酸）、免疫调节（短链脂肪酸产生）和生态位排斥。提及Blautia spp.可能与肉碱依赖机制有关。指出抗原模拟、TLR激活和小分子分泌是潜在的通用机制。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ed51308a119087567f15d8b466bfe48bffa1bfeb7fa01cda43973c9a1479fb1f",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a709cbd0bbb6cabb25b3ce5632d7e9177859a4c8d9c440d62ef4f1c9d62352ab",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
